        dcterms:description "Bozorg et al. (2014) stress-vs-strain cue discrimination, 24-cell laser ablation ring, and 5-condition perturbation sweep" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py#L318-L441> .

