        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Implements the 4-zone pressurized shell & viscoplastic Lockhart solver (`solve_meristem_zone_shell_mechanics`, L101-235), 2D finite-element meristem shell stress field (`build_2d_meristem_fem_field`, L238-312), and Bozorg et al. (2014) stress-vs-strain cue comparison + Kirsch single-cell laser ablation ring + katanin (`bot1`/`ktn1`) & Oryzalin perturbation suite (`simulate_bozorg_stress_vs_strain_and_ablation`, L318-441), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_036_microtubule_stress_meristem.lean`." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
